  "description": "Variational is a peer-to-peer derivatives protocol on Arbitrum that clears and settles trades on-chain. Its first app, Omni, lets users trade perpetuals on crypto and traditional markets from a single cross-margined USDC account, with the Omni Liquidity Provider quoting and taking the other side of every trade.",
  "description_zh": "Variational 是 Arbitrum 上的点对点衍生品协议，在链上清算和结算交易。其首个应用 Omni 让用户在单一全仓 USDC 账户中交易加密货币和传统市场的永续合约，由 Omni 流动性提供者（OLP）为每笔交易报价并作为对手方。",
